    ],
    "text": "regulations made by the Minister of Fisheries under Section 61(1) (sa) and (sb) of the Fisheries and Aquatic Resources Act, No. 2 of 1996. Douglas Devananda, Minister of Fisheries.Colombo,29th January, 2024.",
    "fonts": [
