    "bbox": [
      47.97,
      525.18,
      542.52,
      584.51
    ],
    "text": "Regulations The Issuance of Certificates of Competence for Skippers (Local Fishing Boats) Regulations, 2019 published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2126/6 of June 3, 2019 are hereby amended in regulation 10 thereof, by the insertion of the following regulations immediately after regulation 10 thereof:-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.99,
      595.37,
      542.47,
      608.51
    ],
    "text": "\u201c10A. A skipper license issued to any person under regulation 10, may be suspended or revoked for such period as",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      103.95,
      607.37,
      542.48,
      644.51
    ],
    "text": "may be determined by the Director-General, if such person is found to have been engaged in fishing operations in contravention of the provisions of the Fisheries and Aquatic Resources Act, No. 2 of 1996 and regulations made thereunder.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.95,
      655.37,
      542.47,
      668.51
    ],
    "text": "10B. A skipper whose license has been suspended or revoked under regulation 10A, shall not serve as a skipper or",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      103.96,
      667.37,
      542.46,
      692.51
    ],
    "text": "as a crew member on any local fishing boat specified in regulation 2 of these regulations, for such period as may be determined by the Director General under regulation 10A.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
